{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In SAM0, experience a unique card-based Roguelike battle.</strong> Play as an AI relic of human civilization, exploring planets, making choices, and managing resources. Face diverse organic and mechanical foes, unlock the tech tree, open packs to build your deck, and unravel the mystery of why humanity left this planet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687740/extras/base.png?t=1751501432\" /></div><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 primary elements plus 3 sub-elements for deep tactical synergy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freely combine 100+ cards to strategize pre-combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random routes, events, and battles ensure endless freshness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Permanent upgrades through tech trees and resource investments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize gameplay with chip power-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rich narrative fragments across events, enemy bios, and environmental storytelling</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687740/extras/carddeck.png?t=1751501432\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In SAM0, <strong>no strategy is off-limits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge your own path and conquer the game with your distinct playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687740/extras/8339b0b7218e774794202b5f10b5b0ea.avif?t=1751501432\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3687740?t=1751501432","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepageba